            "paragraph": "Here we compare the proposed L1L2 model with the depth-integrated higher-order models of the authors of the ISMIP-HOM paper (Pattyn and others, 2008). Namely, we compare it with the L1L1 and L1L2 models of group 'rhi' that are based on the work of Hindmarsh (2004) and solved with spectral elements, the L1L2 model by group 'dpo' (Pollard and Deconto, 2007) solved with finite differences and the L1L1 model by group 'Ipe' based on MacAyeal (1989) and Pattyn (2003) and solved with finite differences.",
